  "body": "## Summary\n- Records the 2026-11-22 owner decision on #5415 in the declarative layer: the fleet supports **both** remote-desktop routes.\n- `nixos/hosts/amd-krdp.nix`: KRdp remains the Plasma-session route; not starting under Hyprland is by design.\n- `nixos/hosts/amd-sunshine.nix`: names this module as the sanctioned Hyprland-session route (KMS capture, no portal backend needed).\n\nComment-only change; no service, package, or unit behaviour changes. No credentials referenced or stored.\n\nRefs #5415\n\n## Verification\n- `nix-instantiate --parse` on both files — pass.\n- `git diff --check` — pass.\n- Live route (b) evidence (laptop, Hyprland seat session): `sunshine.service` active since 2026-11-16, listening on 47984/47989/47990, web UI answering 401 (auth required), and real Moonlight sessions on 2026-11-22 using KMS capture with `av1_vaapi` (`Creating encoder [av1_vaapi]`, `CLIENT CONNECTED`).\n\n<!-- pm-metadata:start -->\n```json\n{\n  \"direct_parent\": null,\n  \"links\": [],\n  \"lineage\": {\n    \"design\": null,\n    \"roadmap_item\": null,\n    \"priority\": null\n  },\n  \"pm_meta\": 1,\n  \"provenance\": {\n    \"queue_id\": null,\n    \"scheduled_start\": null,\n    \"picked_up_at\": null,\n    \"work_started_at\": null,\n    \"created_at\": \"2026-11-23T20:28:48Z\",\n    \"session_id\": \"ses_e5df6032687ffeu2wJ1jSxcK43\",\n    \"lane\": null,\n    \"host\": \"amd\",\n    \"worktree\": \"/home/user/git/fleet/12734-5415-route-b\",\n    \"model\": null,\n    \"lane_start_issues\": [],\n    \"workspace_ref\": {\n      \"kind\": \"worktree\",\n      \"id\": \"/home/user/git/fleet/12734-5415-route-b\",\n      \"repo\": \"developing-today/code\",\n      \"branch\": \"lane/oc-code-07-12734-5415-route-b\",\n      \"sha\": \"6fca50cd20fa0d2fa04e6c10fe3465f49c665b42\"\n    },\n    \"auth_subject\": \"oc-code-08\",\n    \"stamped_by\": \"fleet 0.1.0 (native)\"\n  }\n}\n```\n<!-- pm-metadata:end -->\n\n<!-- codesmith:footer -->\n---\n<a href=\"https://dashboardbackend.blacksmith.sh/track/run-proof?expires=1798057734&installation_model_id=443529&pr_number=13683&ref=codesmith_pr_footer&repository=developing-today%2Fcode&return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fdeveloping-today%2Fcode%2Fpull%2F13683&variant=proof_this_pr&signature=e84a4eb1573c2eb3967fe6a8fedf00b098218e1d654ae77abbc340780419b129\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/proof-proof-this-pr-v2-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/proof-proof-this-pr-v2-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Proof this PR\" src=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/proof-proof-this-pr-v2-dark-3x.png\" width=\"121\" height=\"28\"></picture></a>\n<sup><a href=\"https://app.blacksmith.sh/developing-today/codesmith/code/pr/13683?autoLogin=true&ref=codesmith_pr_footer\">Open in [code]smith</a> · Need help on this PR? Tag <code>@codesmith-bot</code> with what you need.</sup>\n\n<!-- codesmith:autofix:disabled -->\n<!-- /codesmith:footer -->",
